[TEXT] Fascinating — the r6_r3 direct link is clean (0% loss in both directions, ARP resolved). But router3 still can't reach 172.18.51.16. This means the failure is in the **transit path through router6** — router6 is not forwarding packets from router3 onwards. Let me check if IP forwarding is enabled on router6 and whether any firewall rules are blocking transit traffic.
